[I] A C library for reading, creating, and modifying zip archives

[T] Libzip is a C library for reading, creating, and modifying zip
[T] archives. Files can be added from data buffers, files, or compressed data
[T] copied directly from other zip archives. Changes made without closing
[T] the archive can be reverted. The API is documented by man pages.

[U] https://libzip.org/

